    <section class="cv-header">
      <h1>EDUARDO MORAES RITTER</h1>
      <p>+55 (11) 96776-5407 | eduardo.moraes.ritter@gmail.com</p>
      <p>linkedin.com/in/eduardomoraesritter | github.com/EduardoMoraesRitter</p>
