      <h2>HABILIDADES TÉCNICAS</h2>

      <h3>Linguagens &amp; Testes:</h3>
      <p>Golang, Python, Node.js, Testes (unitários, integração, performance)</p>

      <h3>Ciência de Dados &amp; IA:</h3>
      <p>LLMs (ChatGPT, Claude, Ollama, Hugging Face), RAG, LlamaIndex, Vector Search (DBVector, Embeddings), Spark, TensorFlow, Scikit-learn, ML/DL (KNN, ANN, SysRec)</p>

      <h3>Engenharia de Dados:</h3>
      <p>ETL/ELT (Airbyte, AWS Glue, Databricks, Redshift, BigQuery, Firestore), NoSQL (MongoDB, Neo4j), Mensageria (RabbitMQ, Kafka) &amp; Observabilidade (Grafana, Datadog)</p>

      <h3>Cloud &amp; Infra:</h3>
      <p>GCP, AWS, IBM, Azure, Docker, Kubernetes, Microservices, Serverless, CDN, Object Storage (S3, GCP Storage), CI/CD (Git, Git Flow)</p>

      <h3>Metodologias &amp; Liderança:</h3>
      <p>Scrum, Kanban, Flow &amp; Cultura de Feedback, OKR &amp; Lean</p>
